	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You teleport an object to your hand. You must have designated the object as the target of your summoning by holding it and imbuing it with psionic energy before leaving it. You may only have one designated object at a time.</p><p><strong>Surge.</strong> You can spend +1 psionic point to summon the object from a distance of up to 10 miles; +2 psionic points to summon the object from any location on the same planet [requires power rating III]; +3 psionic points to summon the object from any location in the same star system [requires power rating IV].</p>",
